⭐ MOST IMPORTANT VIVA DEFINITIONS
Procedure

Procedure is a reusable PL/SQL block that performs task but does not return value.

Function

Function is a PL/SQL block that returns a value.

Trigger

Trigger automatically executes when database event occurs.

Exception

Exception handles runtime errors.

Cursor

Cursor processes rows one by one.

Aggregate

Aggregation performs calculations on grouped documents.

Index

Index improves searching performance
